{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812220/extras/6c5dac8fccf008bceeb127209dfaae27.poster.avif?t=1755300277\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812220/extras/6c5dac8fccf008bceeb127209dfaae27.webm?t=1755300277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812220/extras/6c5dac8fccf008bceeb127209dfaae27.mp4?t=1755300277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Versalis is a fast-paced tactical card-flipping CCG, where heroes and villains face off as worlds collide! Draft a hand of 8 champions from different worlds, each with their own unique stories, abilities and connections. Battle your opponents' cards and flip them to your side.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FLIP YOUR WAY TO VICTORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812220/extras/dcb5ab05e298a2b325170d2a98024777.poster.avif?t=1755300277\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812220/extras/dcb5ab05e298a2b325170d2a98024777.webm?t=1755300277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812220/extras/dcb5ab05e298a2b325170d2a98024777.mp4?t=1755300277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each player drafts a small deck of eight cards and takes turns placing them on the board. When you place a card next to an opponent\u2019s, higher adjacent edges let you flip that card to your side and gain points. When the board is full or all players are out of cards, the player with the most points wins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Versalis is easy to learn, and up to four players can join the fun. Will you cleverly outmaneuver your foes, or will your cards be turned against you?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNLEASH POWERFUL DYNAMICS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812220/extras/70dcc07e8eafb747d8f4149b3cbe0473.poster.avif?t=1755300277\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812220/extras/70dcc07e8eafb747d8f4149b3cbe0473.webm?t=1755300277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812220/extras/70dcc07e8eafb747d8f4149b3cbe0473.mp4?t=1755300277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamics can be activated when certain characters or factions appear together on the board, bringing their intertwined narratives into play. Whether aligning with allies or manipulating opponents, these dynamic interactions can turn the tide of each match, creating a new experience each game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mastering Dynamics doesn't just enrich your strategy; it immerses you deeper into the world of Versalis, where every choice can unlock unexpected twists and victories.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD YOUR COLLECTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812220/extras/eda5229e3cc4b0d74b6b7fc3311aae87.poster.avif?t=1755300277\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812220/extras/eda5229e3cc4b0d74b6b7fc3311aae87.webm?t=1755300277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812220/extras/eda5229e3cc4b0d74b6b7fc3311aae87.mp4?t=1755300277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Versalis has over 50 cards to collect, with different rarities and even special alternate art versions. Win booster packs by playing matches and completing trials, or convert duplicate cards into tokens you can use to craft the specific cards you need.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3812220?t=1755300277","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3812220?t=1755300277","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812220/01749d09b55a19d10ea3553cb1c6a572a9dbd1fb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755300277","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812220/01749d09b55a19d10ea3553cb1c6a572a9dbd1fb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755300277","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812220/extras/6c5dac8fccf008bceeb127209dfaae27.poster.avif?t=1755300277\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812220/extras/6c5dac8fccf008bceeb127209dfaae27.webm?t=1755300277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812220/extras/6c5dac8fccf008bceeb127209dfaae27.mp4?t=1755300277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Versalis is a fast-paced tactical card-flipping CCG, where heroes and villains face off as worlds collide! Draft a hand of 8 champions from different worlds, each with their own unique stories, abilities and connections. Battle your opponents' cards and flip them to your side.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FLIP YOUR WAY TO VICTORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812220/extras/dcb5ab05e298a2b325170d2a98024777.poster.avif?t=1755300277\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812220/extras/dcb5ab05e298a2b325170d2a98024777.webm?t=1755300277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812220/extras/dcb5ab05e298a2b325170d2a98024777.mp4?t=1755300277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each player drafts a small deck of eight cards and takes turns placing them on the board. When you place a card next to an opponent\u2019s, higher adjacent edges let you flip that card to your side and gain points. When the board is full or all players are out of cards, the player with the most points wins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Versalis is easy to learn, and up to four players can join the fun. Will you cleverly outmaneuver your foes, or will your cards be turned against you?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNLEASH POWERFUL DYNAMICS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812220/extras/70dcc07e8eafb747d8f4149b3cbe0473.poster.avif?t=1755300277\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812220/extras/70dcc07e8eafb747d8f4149b3cbe0473.webm?t=1755300277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812220/extras/70dcc07e8eafb747d8f4149b3cbe0473.mp4?t=1755300277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamics can be activated when certain characters or factions appear together on the board, bringing their intertwined narratives into play. Whether aligning with allies or manipulating opponents, these dynamic interactions can turn the tide of each match, creating a new experience each game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mastering Dynamics doesn't just enrich your strategy; it immerses you deeper into the world of Versalis, where every choice can unlock unexpected twists and victories.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD YOUR COLLECTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812220/extras/eda5229e3cc4b0d74b6b7fc3311aae87.poster.avif?t=1755300277\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812220/extras/eda5229e3cc4b0d74b6b7fc3311aae87.webm?t=1755300277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812220/extras/eda5229e3cc4b0d74b6b7fc3311aae87.mp4?t=1755300277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Versalis has over 50 cards to collect, with different rarities and even special alternate art versions. Win booster packs by playing matches and completing trials, or convert duplicate cards into tokens you can use to craft the specific cards you need.</p>","developers":["Aggressive Combustion"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812220/8128876b26d1013c4d3e1b228846b55a85af2399/header.jpg?t=1755300